                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ### Example user template template
### Example user template

# IntelliJ project files
.idea
*.iml
out
gen
# host-script config + logs (added 2026-06-16 for relocated cluster scripts)
.env
# ...and any hand-made copy of it. A `cp .env .env.bak-$(date +%s)` before editing is
# the obvious thing to do, and the result is NOT covered by the `.env` line above — it
# carries the same live JENKINS_CRED / GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD and got auto-staged once.
.env.bak-*
.env.*.bak
logs/
